<title>UK: Abbey National adds 50 bln lire to bond.</title>
<headline>Abbey National adds 50 bln lire to bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 400 billion lire from 350 billion lire, joint lead managers Banca Commerciale Italiano, Cariplo and J.P. Morgan said on Tuesday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ABBEY NATIONAL TREASURY SERVICES PLC</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  ABBEY NATIONAL PLC</p>
<p> AMT    400 BLN LIRE  COUPON    *8.0	 MATURITY   *01.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE   FIX/REV FRN   ISS PRICE  99.85     PAY DATE    03.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA2/AA    DENOMS (K) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  BRITAIN   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO 01.MAR.02, THEN 21 PERCENT MINUS (TWO TIMES</p>
<p>		 12-MONTH LIBOR) IF NOT CALLED AT PAR</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
